MONGODB_URI=mongodb://127.0.0.1:27017/cls
AUTH_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string
APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@cls.local
ADMIN_PASSWORD=change-me-now

SMTP_HOST=
SMTP_PORT=587
SMTP_USER=
SMTP_PASS=
First run (dev server already up): POST http://localhost:3000/api/setup
That creates the admin user from ADMIN_EMAIL / ADMIN_PASSWORD and loads starter copy.
